  "note": "The package ships the three host objects the purchase service and the protocol factory take. createPurchaseOperations is the test harness's operations store moved into src/host/purchase-ops.mjs, on the host's own store, with a required handoff secret and lifetime and only the purchase kind. createPurchaseChallenges issues and consumes approval challenges for one purpose under one origin fixed at construction; purchaseApprovalChallengeText is its signed text. createLocalPurchaseAccount writes the one local account named after the wallet. isPurchaseOperationId checks the id the operations store mints. The README documents the adapters and its contract test probes the names it uses; the composition world gains an option that runs on the shipped adapters. The purchase service, the protocol factory, the schema and the test harness are unchanged."
